@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health check - sabse pehle ye chalao
GET {{host}}/health

### Document upload (Indexing phase)
POST {{host}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "itsm-policy.md",
  "content": "P1 ticket ka resolution SLA 4 ghante hai.\n\nP2 ka 8 ghante, P3 ka 24 ghante aur P4 ka 72 ghante hai.\n\nAgar koi ticket 3 working days tak Awaiting User state me rehta hai to system use apne aap Closed kar deta hai."
}

### Indexed documents ki list
GET {{host}}/api/documents

### Plain RAG - retrieve + generate, citations ke saath
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "P1 ticket ka SLA kitne ghante ka hai?"
}

### Agent - tools chalega (search_documents / get_ticket_status)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "INC-1001 ka status batao aur uski priority ka SLA bhi"
}

### Agent + memory - upar wale response ka sessionId yahan daalo
POST {{host}}/api/agent/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "aur uska owner kaun hai?",
  "sessionId": "PASTE_SESSION_ID_HERE"
}

### Agent streaming (SSE) - token-by-token aayega
POST {{host}}/api/agent/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Leave apply karne ka process kya hai?"
}
